{"product":{"id":10225820139809,"title":"Ultralight Subscription","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing our new ultra light only sub!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShips out on the 15th. Orders close on the 1st. Renewal on the 1st. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a new subscription from us that only features the lightest roasters in the world. Our original subscription models feature a range of roast profiles, from light-medium - ultralight. Each month, you will receive 3x coffees from 3x different roasters. These will be mostly washed, cleaner coffees (though we will also feature honeys and naturals). \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubscribing to this will give you the same early access (which includes a 10% discount) benefits to our weekly releases. Unlike our other subscriptions, this will feature a mix of US \u0026amp; International roasters to really showcase our favorite UL roasters. This is also a smaller pool of roasters, so roasters will likely be repeated a few times a year (though never with the same coffees).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSome examples of roasters that will be on the sub:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e ☆ GWO\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e ☆ Dongze\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e ☆ Big Sur\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e ☆ XLIII\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e ☆ Shoebox\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e ☆ H \u0026amp; S\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e ☆ Nai Zui\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e ☆ September EL\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Airworks Coffee","product_type":"","created_at":"2026-01-17T17:13:55-08:00","handle":"ultralight-sub","updated_at":"2026-10-08T15:23:55-07:00","published_at":"2026-03-01T09:58:21-08:00","template_suffix":"subscription","published_scope":"web","tags":"Subscription","variants":[{"id":52226645459233,"product_id":10225820139809,"title":"3x 100g bags (300g total)","price":"48.00","sku":null,"position":1,"compare_at_price":"0.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","invent